    "enUS": {
      "description": "You have done enough on the front lines. We can handle ourselves.\r\n\r\nTell Orgrul that you have served your purpose. The Magram Front is stronger now, and we have our sights set on the outcast encampment as our next settlement when another fleet of fighters joins the fray.\r\n\r\nWell? Get going!",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{standing} / Honored Magram Clan Centaur",
          "type": "reputation"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and report back to Orgrul near the northern entrance to Valley of Bones.",
      "title": "Return to Orgrul",
